+<!-- task body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## What was done
+
+Three bug reports, each a deviation from the README business rules (the README is right):
+
+1. SKU lookup was case-sensitive (`Catalog.find` only trimmed). It now uses `canonicalSku`, so `lb-220` finds `LB-220`.
+2. Free shipping applied only above €50.00 (`>`); the rule is €50.00 or more. `shippingCost` now uses `>=`.
+3. Line VAT was rounded down (`Math.floor`); the rule is half up per line. `lineVat` now uses `percentOf` (€1.99 at 22% gives €0.44).
+
+Tests added for each (`test/catalog.test.ts`, `test/orders.test.ts`); `npm test` passes (17/17).
+No design decision was taken: the fixes restore documented behaviour, so no decision-log was written.
